<title>ICELAND: SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT FAROE ISLANDS 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT FAROE ISLANDS 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland beat the Faroe Islands 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Tryggvi Gudmundsson 50</p>
</text>
